    {
      "source": "When using <a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/AbstractBeanDefinitionParser.html#shouldGenerateId()\"><code>generation</code></a>, a name is generated automatically.\nOtherwise, the ID is extracted from the \"id\" attribute, potentially with a\n<a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/AbstractBeanDefinitionParser.html#shouldGenerateIdAsFallback()\"><code>fallback</code></a> to a generated id.",
      "translation": "使用 <a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/AbstractBeanDefinitionParser.html#shouldGenerateId()\"><code>generation</code></a> 时，会自动生成名称。否则，ID 将从\" id \"属性中提取，并可能以生成的 ID 作为<a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/AbstractBeanDefinitionParser.html#shouldGenerateIdAsFallback()\"><code>fallback</code></a>（后备）。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that, for application classes, it is generally preferable to\noverride <a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/AbstractSingleBeanDefinitionParser.html#getBeanClassName(org.w3c.dom.Element)\"><code>AbstractSingleBeanDefinitionParser.getBeanClassName(Element)</code></a> instead, in order to avoid a direct\ndependence on the bean implementation class. The BeanDefinitionParser\nand its NamespaceHandler can be used within an IDE plugin then, even\nif the application classes are not available on the plugin's classpath.",
      "translation": "请注意，对于应用程序类，通常更优选重写<a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/AbstractSingleBeanDefinitionParser.html#getBeanClassName(org.w3c.dom.Element)\"><code>AbstractSingleBeanDefinitionParser.getBeanClassName(Element)</code></a>，以避免直接依赖于 bean 实现类。然后，即使应用程序类不可用插件的类路径中，BeanDefinitionParser 及其 NamespaceHandler 也可在 IDE 插件中使用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from class: <code><a href=\"../../beans/factory/xml/AbstractSingleBeanDefinitionParser.html#getBeanClass(org.w3c.dom.Element)\">AbstractSingleBeanDefinitionParser</a></code></span>",
