    {
      "source": "Determine the bean class corresponding to the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a>.",
      "translation": "确定与提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a> 对应的 bean 类。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Parser for the &lt;tx:jta-transaction-manager/&gt; XML configuration element.",
      "translation": "&lt;tx:jta-transaction-manager/&gt; XML 配置元素的解析器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a> of the bean that is being defined via parsing\nthe supplied <code>Element</code>, or <code>null</code> if none",
      "translation": "正在通过解析提供的 `<code>Element` 定义 Bean 的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Class</code></a>，或者如果没有则为 `<code>null</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>parserContext</code> - the object encapsulating the current state of the parsing process;\nprovides access to a <a href=\"../../beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>parserContext</code> - 封装当前解析过程状态的对象；提供对<a href=\"../../beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionRegistry.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionRegistry</code></a>的访问",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>element</code> - the <code>Element</code> that is being parsed",
      "translation": "<code>element</code> - 正在被解析的 <code>Element</code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>element</code> - the element that the bean definition has been built from",
